<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CSX restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSX restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said on Tuesday it reinstated coverage of CSX Corp with a neutral rating intermediate-term and a buy rating long-term.  </p>
<p>-- Merrill analyst Michael Lloyd said in a research note his 1997 earnings estimate was $4.15 per share and his 1998 earnings estimate was $4.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock is at an attractive 34 percent discount to the S&amp;P 500 1997 (estimated price-to-earnings ratio), but the earnings volatility at Sea-Land's containership operations continues to trouble investors,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
